{"title":"Pretender","artist":"오피셜히게단디즘","sourceId":"reference:4FhpW3YP2PQzGXmATCKU","sourceHash":"a88f7baacc771cb908b9979b7111baef6874dd4c1e1b456c1571ff0d4c0fb14b","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":3821917,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":32.13,"end":35.43,"text":"君とのラブストーリー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":35.43,"end":38.24,"text":"それは予想通り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":38.24,"end":42.37,"text":"いざ始まればひとり芝居だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":42.37,"end":44.85,"text":"ずっとそばにいたって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":44.85,"end":47.89,"text":"結局ただの観客だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":47.89,"end":51.08,"text":"感情のないアイムソーリー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":51.08,"end":53.63,"text":"それはいつも通り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":53.63,"end":57.86,"text":"慣れてしまえば悪くはないけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":57.86,"end":61.6,"text":"君とのロマンスは人生柄","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":61.6,"end":68.47,"text":"続きはしないことを知った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":68.47,"end":73.58,"text":"もっと違う設定で もっと違う関係で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":73.58,"end":78.81,"text":"出会える世界線 選べたらよかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":78.81,"end":84.07,"text":"もっと違う性格で もっと違う価値観で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":84.07,"end":93.9,"text":"愛を伝えられたらいいな そう願っても無駄だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":93.9,"end":95.05,"text":"グッバイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":95.05,"end":99.64,"text":"君の運命のヒトは僕じゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":99.64,"end":105.85,"text":"辛いけど否めない でも離れ難いのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":105.85,"end":111.27000000000001,"text":"その髪に触れただけで 痛いや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":111.27000000000001,"end":114.77000000000001,"text":"いやでも 甘いな いやいや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":114.77000000000001,"end":115.53999999999999,"text":"グッバイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":115.53999999999999,"end":120.37,"text":"それじゃ僕にとって君は何？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":120.37,"end":126.67,"text":"答えは分からない 分かりたくもないのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":126.67,"end":134.78,"text":"たったひとつ確かなことがあるとするのならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":134.78,"end":139.42000000000002,"text":"「君は綺麗だ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":141.93,"end":144.82999999999998,"text":"誰かが偉そうに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":144.82999999999998,"end":147.57999999999998,"text":"語る恋愛の論理","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":147.57999999999998,"end":151.76,"text":"何ひとつとしてピンとこなくて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":151.76,"end":155.43,"text":"飛行機の窓から見下ろした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":155.43,"end":162.38,"text":"知らない街の夜景みたいだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":162.38,"end":167.32,"text":"もっと違う設定で もっと違う関係で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":167.32,"end":172.76,"text":"出会える世界線 選べたらよかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":172.76,"end":177.7,"text":"いたって純な心で 叶った恋を抱きしめて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":177.7,"end":182.47,"text":"「好きだ」とか無責任に言えたらいいな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":182.47,"end":187.93,"text":"そう願っても虚しいのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":187.93,"end":188.66,"text":"グッバイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":188.66,"end":193.56,"text":"繋いだ手の向こうにエンドライン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":193.56,"end":199.71,"text":"引き伸ばすたびに 疼きだす未来には","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":199.71,"end":207.49,"text":"君はいない その事実に Cry...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":207.49,"end":211.06,"text":"そりゃ苦しいよな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":229.63,"end":230.52,"text":"グッバイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":230.52,"end":235.27,"text":"君の運命のヒトは僕じゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":235.27,"end":241.62,"text":"辛いけど否めない でも離れ難いのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":241.62,"end":246.73,"text":"その髪に触れただけで 痛いや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":246.73,"end":250.44,"text":"いやでも 甘いな いやいや","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":250.44,"end":251.33,"text":"グッバイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":251.33,"end":256.09,"text":"それじゃ僕にとって君は何？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":256.09,"end":262.5,"text":"答えは分からない 分かりたくもないのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":262.5,"end":270.39,"text":"たったひとつ確かなことがあるとするのならば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":270.39,"end":272.65999999999997,"text":"「君は綺麗だ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":272.65999999999997,"end":282.96,"text":"それもこれもロマンスの定めなら 悪くないよな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":282.96,"end":291.04,"text":"永遠も約束もないけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":291.04,"end":292.53,"text":"「とても綺麗だ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}